      <title>SK海力士考虑在日本建合资企业 崔泰源确认考察电力水资源充足地点</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260831/SK%E6%B5%B7%E5%8A%9B%E5%A3%AB%E8%80%83%E8%99%91%E5%9C%A8%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E5%BB%BA%E5%90%88%E8%B5%84%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A-%E5%B4%94%E6%B3%B0%E6%BA%90%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E8%80%83%E5%AF%9F%E7%94%B5%E5%8A%9B%E6%B0%B4%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%E5%85%85%E8%B6%B3%E5%9C%B0%E7%82%B9/</link>
